kMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果CarPlay正式接入谷歌Gemini，支持Gemini Live语音交互</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Runway开源27B世界动作模型Praxis-1，登顶RoboLab-120榜单并支持商业化</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI第三季度营收突破100亿美元，环比增长近50%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Decisions API及Decision 1模型，支持单次处理千题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/192786bef6037ee049587bbb3888c62a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月11日正式推出Gemini Decisions API，搭载专为快速决策场景设计的Gemini Decision 1模型。该API支持文本、图像、音频、视频及PDF等多模态输入，上下文窗口最高达256K Tokens。开发者单次调用即可处理最多1000个独立问题，模型通过一次前向计算输出各选项的概率与置信度分数，显著优化了工具挑选、策略核查及模型路由等任务的执行效率。在性能方面，该API处理延迟控制在150至250毫秒之间。定价策略极具竞争力，输入端价格为每百万Tokens 0.10美元，输出端Tokens完全免费。此外，开发者可根据需求手动调节图像与视频分辨率，以平衡视觉细节与Token开销。目前，Gemini Decisions API已在Google AI Studio上线，并提供免费额度供开</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 DeepMind 发布 AlphaGenome 2 模型，实现细胞级基因变异预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b498c4b0df3b7a4a775e07ada9d03bef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 DeepMind 于 11 月 11 日推出 AlphaGenome 2，将基因变异预测精度提升至单个细胞类型与状态。该模型采用条件式架构，通过训练人与小鼠超 1.07 亿个单细胞图谱（覆盖 68 种组织），识别相关变异的能力较上一代提升近两倍。在 TenK10K 测试中，其致病变异识别率达 30%，预测表达变化准确率从 23% 提升至 43%。AlphaGenome 2 具备强大的泛化能力，仅需少量单细胞 RNA 测序数据即可分析未见过的细胞类型，并新增对组蛋白修饰、染色质可及性及 DNA 甲基化的预测，支持跨模态推断。目前，该模型已通过 AlphaGenome API 向非商业研究开放，商业用途需申请私有预览。谷歌明确表示该工具仅限科研用途，尚未获得临床或诊断批准，旨在解决疾病基因定位中细胞异质性带来</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果CarPlay正式接入谷歌Gemini，支持Gemini Live语音交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/31723c931fbb5edbec6868466a235a59.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果CarPlay已正式接入谷歌Gemini AI，即日起面向全球iOS端Gemini用户分批推送，支持Gemini Live覆盖的所有语言。iPhone 18 Pro等机型用户连接CarPlay后，可通过车机屏幕直接调用Gemini图标发起语音对话。该功能支持随时插话、话题续接及多轮交互，对话内容将同步至手机端Gemini应用，方便停车后查看摘要与笔记。除语音交流外，Gemini还深度集成Gmail与Google日历，可协助驾驶者处理日程、整理邮件、获取每日简报及查询目的地周边信息。用户需确保手机端Gemini应用更新至最新版本并完成Gemini Live首次配置，授予麦克风权限后即可在车机端使用。此次接入标志着苹果车联生态进一步开放，通过引入大模型能力，显著提升了车载语音助手的交互深度与办公辅助效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Runway开源27B世界动作模型Praxis-1，登顶RoboLab-120榜单并支持商业化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9d67364595409ee9f6582ed6467d4d18.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Runway正式开源270亿参数的世界动作模型Praxis-1，采用Apache 2.0协议，全面开放模型权重、推理及微调代码。该模型采用MoE Diffusion Transformer架构，核心优势在于能同时预测视频与动作。在NVIDIA RoboLab-120基准测试中，Praxis-1以46.2%的成功率位居榜首，超越FLUX3Action及π0.5等模型。在迁移泛化测试中，其在Google RT-1机器人上的成功率从52.4%提升至80.0%。硬件适配方面，Praxis-1支持从H100、B200数据中心GPU到RTX 5090工作站显卡，以及Jetson Thor边缘端侧芯片的部署。开发者可通过GitHub和Hugging Face获取模型，并支持vLLM-Omni、Reactor推理及LoRA微调</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI第三季度营收突破100亿美元，环比增长近50%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI第三季度营收首次突破100亿美元，较第二季度的67亿美元环比增长近50%，显示出公司在经历增长放缓后的强劲复苏。得益于市场对AI模型需求的提升及近期产品发布，公司调整后营业利润率从第二季度的-150%收窄至第三季度的-109%，盈利状况有所改善。目前OpenAI年收入已达500亿美元，公司正通过收紧定价策略、调整折扣、改进模型以及加大企业级产品和AI Agent投入来驱动增长。尽管用户规模超10亿，但OpenAI在企业级市场仍面临Anthropic等竞争对手的激烈挑战。由于统计口径差异，Anthropic将云合作伙伴销售额计入，而OpenAI仅统计部分分成。面对Meta、亚马逊、微软及谷歌等巨头的竞争，OpenAI在算力成本、市场份额及模型定价方面仍面临多重压力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
